            "id": "3aed-30ad-bff6-596b",
            "description": "This admiral uses strict discipline to maintain an orderly fleet. The sailors may love him or hate him, but his rigid philosophy gets results. Once per battle, after one of your ships fails a Discipline test, you may change the resul of that test to a success.",
            "hidden": false
          }
